{
  "page": 452,
  "lang": "ar",
  "edition": "quran-uthmani",
  "ayahs": [
    {
      "number": 3942,
      "text": "Mengapa kamu ini? Bagaimana (caranya) kamu menetapkan?",
      "surah": {
        "number": 37,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الصَّافَّاتِ",
        "englishName": "As-Saaffaat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Those drawn up in Ranks",
        "numberOfAyahs": 182,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 154,
      "juz": 23,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 452,
      "ruku": 390,
      "hizbQuarter": 181,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3943,
      "text": "Maka mengapa kamu tidak memikirkan?",
      "surah": {
        "number": 37,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الصَّافَّاتِ",
        "englishName": "As-Saaffaat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Those drawn up in Ranks",
        "numberOfAyahs": 182,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 155,
      "juz": 23,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 452,
      "ruku": 390,
      "hizbQuarter": 181,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3944,
      "text": "Ataukah kamu mempunyai bukti yang jelas?",
      "surah": {
        "number": 37,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الصَّافَّاتِ",
        "englishName": "As-Saaffaat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Those drawn up in Ranks",
        "numberOfAyahs": 182,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 156,
      "juz": 23,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 452,
      "ruku": 390,
      "hizbQuarter": 181,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3945,
      "text": "(Kalau begitu) maka bawalah kitabmu jika kamu orang yang benar.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 37,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الصَّافَّاتِ",
        "englishName": "As-Saaffaat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Those drawn up in Ranks",
        "numberOfAyahs": 182,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 157,
      "juz": 23,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 452,
      "ruku": 390,
      "hizbQuarter": 181,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3946,
      "text": "Dan mereka mengadakan (hubungan) nasab (keluarga) antara Dia (Allah) dan jin. Dan sungguh, jin telah mengetahui bahwa mereka pasti akan diseret (ke neraka).",
      "surah": {
        "number": 37,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الصَّافَّاتِ",
        "englishName": "As-Saaffaat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Those drawn up in Ranks",
        "numberOfAyahs": 182,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 158,
      "juz": 23,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 452,
      "ruku": 390,
      "hizbQuarter": 181,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3947,
      "text": "Mahasuci Allah dari apa yang mereka sifatkan,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 37,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الصَّافَّاتِ",
        "englishName": "As-Saaffaat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Those drawn up in Ranks",
        "numberOfAyahs": 182,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 159,
      "juz": 23,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 452,
      "ruku": 390,
      "hizbQuarter": 181,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3948,
      "text": "kecuali hamba-hamba Allah[741] yang disucikan (dari dosa).",
      "surah": {
        "number": 37,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الصَّافَّاتِ",
        "englishName": "As-Saaffaat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Those drawn up in Ranks",
        "numberOfAyahs": 182,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 160,
      "juz": 23,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 452,
      "ruku": 390,
      "hizbQuarter": 181,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3949,
      "text": "Maka sesungguhnya kamu dan apa yang kamu sembah itu,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 37,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الصَّافَّاتِ",
        "englishName": "As-Saaffaat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Those drawn up in Ranks",
        "numberOfAyahs": 182,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 161,
      "juz": 23,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 452,
      "ruku": 390,
      "hizbQuarter": 181,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3950,
      "text": "tidak akan dapat menyesatkan (seseorang) terhadap Allah,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 37,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الصَّافَّاتِ",
        "englishName": "As-Saaffaat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Those drawn up in Ranks",
        "numberOfAyahs": 182,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 162,
      "juz": 23,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 452,
      "ruku": 390,
      "hizbQuarter": 181,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3951,
      "text": "kecuali orang-orang yang akan masuk ke neraka Jahim.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 37,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الصَّافَّاتِ",
        "englishName": "As-Saaffaat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Those drawn up in Ranks",
        "numberOfAyahs": 182,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 163,
      "juz": 23,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 452,
      "ruku": 390,
      "hizbQuarter": 181,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3952,
      "text": "Dan tidak satu pun di antara kami (malaikat) melainkan masing-masing mempunyai kedudukan tertentu,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 37,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الصَّافَّاتِ",
        "englishName": "As-Saaffaat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Those drawn up in Ranks",
        "numberOfAyahs": 182,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 164,
      "juz": 23,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 452,
      "ruku": 390,
      "hizbQuarter": 181,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3953,
      "text": "dan sesungguhnya kami selalu teratur dalam barisan (dalam melaksanakan perintah Allah).",
      "surah": {
        "number": 37,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الصَّافَّاتِ",
        "englishName": "As-Saaffaat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Those drawn up in Ranks",
        "numberOfAyahs": 182,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 165,
      "juz": 23,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 452,
      "ruku": 390,
      "hizbQuarter": 181,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3954,
      "text": "Dan sungguh, kami benar-benar terus bertasbih (kepada Allah).",
      "surah": {
        "number": 37,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الصَّافَّاتِ",
        "englishName": "As-Saaffaat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Those drawn up in Ranks",
        "numberOfAyahs": 182,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 166,
      "juz": 23,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 452,
      "ruku": 390,
      "hizbQuarter": 181,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3955,
      "text": "Dan sesungguhnya mereka (orang kafir Mekkah) benar-benar pernah berkata,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 37,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الصَّافَّاتِ",
        "englishName": "As-Saaffaat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Those drawn up in Ranks",
        "numberOfAyahs": 182,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 167,
      "juz": 23,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 452,
      "ruku": 390,
      "hizbQuarter": 181,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3956,
      "text": "\"Sekiranya di sisi kami ada suatu kitab dari (kitab-kitab yang diturunkan) kepada orang-orang dahulu,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 37,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الصَّافَّاتِ",
        "englishName": "As-Saaffaat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Those drawn up in Ranks",
        "numberOfAyahs": 182,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 168,
      "juz": 23,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 452,
      "ruku": 390,
      "hizbQuarter": 181,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3957,
      "text": "tentu kami akan menjadi hamba Allah yang disucikan (dari dosa).\"",
      "surah": {
        "number": 37,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الصَّافَّاتِ",
        "englishName": "As-Saaffaat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Those drawn up in Ranks",
        "numberOfAyahs": 182,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 169,
      "juz": 23,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 452,
      "ruku": 390,
      "hizbQuarter": 181,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3958,
      "text": "Tetapi ternyata mereka mengingkarinya (Al-Qur`an); maka kelak mereka akan mengetahui (akibat keingkarannya itu).",
      "surah": {
        "number": 37,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الصَّافَّاتِ",
        "englishName": "As-Saaffaat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Those drawn up in Ranks",
        "numberOfAyahs": 182,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 170,
      "juz": 23,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 452,
      "ruku": 390,
      "hizbQuarter": 181,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3959,
      "text": "Dan sungguh, janji Kami telah tetap bagi hamba-hamba Kami yang menjadi rasul,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 37,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الصَّافَّاتِ",
        "englishName": "As-Saaffaat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Those drawn up in Ranks",
        "numberOfAyahs": 182,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 171,
      "juz": 23,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 452,
      "ruku": 390,
      "hizbQuarter": 181,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3960,
      "text": "(yaitu) mereka itu pasti akan mendapat pertolongan.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 37,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الصَّافَّاتِ",
        "englishName": "As-Saaffaat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Those drawn up in Ranks",
        "numberOfAyahs": 182,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 172,
      "juz": 23,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 452,
      "ruku": 390,
      "hizbQuarter": 181,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3961,
      "text": "Dan sesungguhnya bala tentara Kami[742] itulah yang pasti menang.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 37,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الصَّافَّاتِ",
        "englishName": "As-Saaffaat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Those drawn up in Ranks",
        "numberOfAyahs": 182,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 173,
      "juz": 23,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 452,
      "ruku": 390,
      "hizbQuarter": 181,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3962,
      "text": "Maka berpalinglah engkau (Muhammad) dari mereka sampai waktu tertentu,[743]",
      "surah": {
        "number": 37,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الصَّافَّاتِ",
        "englishName": "As-Saaffaat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Those drawn up in Ranks",
        "numberOfAyahs": 182,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 174,
      "juz": 23,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 452,
      "ruku": 390,
      "hizbQuarter": 181,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3963,
      "text": "dan perlihatkanlah kepada mereka, maka kelak mereka akan melihat (azab itu).",
      "surah": {
        "number": 37,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الصَّافَّاتِ",
        "englishName": "As-Saaffaat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Those drawn up in Ranks",
        "numberOfAyahs": 182,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 175,
      "juz": 23,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 452,
      "ruku": 390,
      "hizbQuarter": 181,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3964,
      "text": "Maka apakah mereka meminta agar azab Kami disegerakan?",
      "surah": {
        "number": 37,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الصَّافَّاتِ",
        "englishName": "As-Saaffaat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Those drawn up in Ranks",
        "numberOfAyahs": 182,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 176,
      "juz": 23,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 452,
      "ruku": 390,
      "hizbQuarter": 181,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3965,
      "text": "Maka apabila (siksaan) itu turun di halaman mereka, maka sangat buruklah pagi hari bagi orang-orang yang diperingatkan.[744]",
      "surah": {
        "number": 37,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الصَّافَّاتِ",
        "englishName": "As-Saaffaat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Those drawn up in Ranks",
        "numberOfAyahs": 182,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 177,
      "juz": 23,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 452,
      "ruku": 390,
      "hizbQuarter": 181,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3966,
      "text": "Dan berpalinglah engkau dari mereka sampai waktu tertentu.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 37,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الصَّافَّاتِ",
        "englishName": "As-Saaffaat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Those drawn up in Ranks",
        "numberOfAyahs": 182,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 178,
      "juz": 23,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 452,
      "ruku": 390,
      "hizbQuarter": 181,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3967,
      "text": "Dan perlihatkanlah, maka kelak mereka akan melihat (azab itu).",
      "surah": {
        "number": 37,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الصَّافَّاتِ",
        "englishName": "As-Saaffaat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Those drawn up in Ranks",
        "numberOfAyahs": 182,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 179,
      "juz": 23,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 452,
      "ruku": 390,
      "hizbQuarter": 181,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3968,
      "text": "Mahasuci Tuhanmu, Tuhan Yang Mahaperkasa dari sifat yang mereka katakan.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 37,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الصَّافَّاتِ",
        "englishName": "As-Saaffaat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Those drawn up in Ranks",
        "numberOfAyahs": 182,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 180,
      "juz": 23,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 452,
      "ruku": 390,
      "hizbQuarter": 181,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3969,
      "text": "Dan selamat sejahtera bagi para rasul.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 37,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الصَّافَّاتِ",
        "englishName": "As-Saaffaat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Those drawn up in Ranks",
        "numberOfAyahs": 182,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 181,
      "juz": 23,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 452,
      "ruku": 390,
      "hizbQuarter": 181,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 3970,
      "text": "Dan segala puji bagi Allah Tuhan seluruh alam.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 37,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الصَّافَّاتِ",
        "englishName": "As-Saaffaat",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Those drawn up in Ranks",
        "numberOfAyahs": 182,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
